<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show steady net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show steady net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Thursday show that net currency reserves were steady at 103.4 billion marks in the week ending January 31 from about 103.4 billion marks in the week ending January 23.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Jan 31	  Jan 23</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     119.2	   119.0</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.8	    15.6</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
